#U pixels     pixels     pixels  pixels  pixels  pixels          ##   cerrors  \
#F %-14.3f    %-11.3f    %-8.3f  %-8.3f  %-8.3f  %-15.3f         %-5d %-9s      
#
#N MSKY           STDEV          SSKEW          NSKY   NSREJ     SIER SERROR   \
